{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"customerInfoStream","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS","text":"AsyncStream","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:13SwiduxPaywall19EntitlementSnapshotV","text":"EntitlementSnapshot","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Yields a new "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EntitlementSnapshot"},{"type":"text","text":" every time RevenueCat reports a change to the user’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"customer info — purchase, refund, family-share update, sandbox renewal. A failed-verification","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"response is skipped. The stream"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"finishes when the underlying RevenueCat stream finishes; the paywall plugin’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".observeCustomerInfo"},{"text":" effect normally keeps it alive for the duration of the session.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A new stream first yields the customer info RevenueCat last delivered in this process, if","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"any. RevenueCat may not have delivered one yet — on a relaunch with a fresh cache it skips"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the launch fetch — and then the stream stays silent until the next change. Dispatch"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":".refreshCustomerInfo","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" alongside ","type":"text"},{"code":".observeCustomerInfo","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to seed the state.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If RevenueCat has not been configured, the stream finishes immediately. Configure RevenueCat, then call this method again to start a live stream."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/RevenueCatPaywallService"]]},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method","title":"customerInfoStream()","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"customerInfoStream"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS","text":"AsyncStream"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13SwiduxPaywall19EntitlementSnapshotV","text":"EntitlementSnapshot"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"externalID":"s:23SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall0bcD7ServiceV18customerInfoStreamScSy0aD019EntitlementSnapshotVGyF","role":"symbol"},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns a long-lived stream of entitlement snapshots derived from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"Purchases.shared.customerInfoStream","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/revenuecatpaywallservice\/customerinfostream()"]}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/RevenueCatPaywallService\/customerInfoStream()"},"references":{"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/RevenueCatPaywallService":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RevenueCatPaywallService"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Reve